# App Builder north star

**Build an app from a Google Sheet.** Staff open a link + PIN. They never get the spreadsheet.

## Why we exist (say this, build this)

Google Sheets cannot do **RBAC**. Everyone with the link sees every row.

Sheetomatic does: owner / staff / PIN, **row owner**, field visibility, screen visibility. That is the product reason — not a prettier Sheet.

## Functions = AppSheet + Glide (one product)

| Side | Ship this |
|---|---|
| AppSheet | Enum, Ref, File, Virtual `[Col]` formulas, view types, bots (WA / email / PDF) |
| Glide | Phone / tablet / desktop, lookup / math / if-then, relations, actions, themes |
| Us | Gmail Sheet, PIN staff (no Workspace seat), WhatsApp + PDF on the same bot |

Do **not** invent a third formula language. Use `[Column]` like AppSheet.

## UI = Apple.com

- Few words. Labeled controls. Cards, not unlabeled dropdown rows.
- One job per surface: **App** = Look, **Data** = columns / relations / computed / RBAC, **Automate** = bots, **People** = who can open what.
- No marketing paragraphs inside inspectors.

## When choosing work

1. Does this make RBAC real (row / field / screen)?
2. Does this make an AppSheet or Glide feature work on the phone?
3. Does the UI stay Apple-quiet?

If no, do not add it.
